### 2. Files Created

- [`docker-compose.yml`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/docker-compose.yml): WAHA container definition.
- [`waha/.env.example`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/waha/.env.example): Environment variable template for WAHA credentials and HMAC secret.
