- [`n8n/workflow-wa-hotlead.json`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/n8n/workflow-wa-hotlead.json): n8n workflow definition.
- [`scoring/indonesian-rules.json`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/scoring/indonesian-rules.json): Indonesian intent keyword dictionary.
- [`scoring/llm-classify-prompt.md`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/scoring/llm-classify-prompt.md): LLM fallback prompt.
- [`README.md`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/README.md): Operator runbook covering Gates 0 through 4.
- [`scripts/import-workflow.sh`](file:///opt/data/projects/wa-hot-lead/scripts/import-workflow.sh): Workflow import script via n8n REST API.

